{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19153","headline":"和乐天以镜换酒 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天以镜换酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"把取菱花百链镜，换他竹叶十旬杯。\n嚬眉厌老终难去，蘸甲须欢便到来。\n妍丑太分迷忌讳，松乔俱傲绝嫌猜。\n校量功力相千万，好去从空白玉台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}